WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Chest on the pad, feet on the platform, handles in both hands, arms straight.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Row the handles up beside your lower ribs, squeezing your shoulder blades.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Lower slowly to straight arms, chest staying on the pad.
